				},
				{
					"id": 741660603,
					"content": "不，這倒沒有。只是我非常不喜歡這個地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741660604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的人"
				},
				{
					"id": 741660604,
					"content": "嗯？為什麼呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741660605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741660605,
					"content": "因為…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741660606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的人"
				},
				{
					"id": 741660606,
					"content": "因為？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741660607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741660607,
					"content": "因為我不想工作！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741660608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的人"
				},
				{
					"id": 741660608,
					"content": "我只是因為不想工作，所以在餓肚子的時候偷了一塊麵包被判了罪，來到這裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741660609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的人"
				},
				{
					"id": 741660609,
					"content": "但是為什麼來了梅洛彼得堡也要工作啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741660610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的人"
				},
				{
					"id": 741660610,
					"content": "「一切的工作都可以擊倒我！」這可是我的人生格言。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741660611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的人"
				},
				{
					"id": 741660611,
					"content": "嗚哇！感覺他在這裡的時候整個人都有點不太對勁，我們還是快離開這裡去下個地方吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
